-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",324,{
[10337]="70067539\n1\tHunt drakes in Jeb Lipha for hide (total: 5)\030Hunt drakelings in Jeb Lipha for phials of acid (total: 8)\tRúkbag has asked you to hunt in Jeb Lipha, east of Kafagur. The hunters require phials of acid from drakelings, as well as hide from the larger drakes.\n2\tTalk to Rúkbag at Kafagur\tYou've collected enough supplies for the Kafagur hunters. You should return to Rúkbag at Kafagur.\n",
[10338]="7000EAAE\n1\tRestock the Kantâ-vilkku\030Collect Snow Beacon Supplies\tThe Kantâ-vilkku is east and a little south of Sûri-kylä in Jä-rannit along the snow drifts over the bay of Forochel. Matti has asked you to visit the Kantâ-vilkku and replace the missing supplies.\n2\tSearch for signs of what destroyed the crates\tThe Kantâ-vilkku is east and a little south of Sûri-kylä in Jä-rannit along the snow drifts over the bay of Forochel. Besides restocking the Kantâ-vilkku, Matti asked you to search near it for signs of what damaged the crates.\n3\tTalk to Matti\tMatti is at Sûri-kylä, west and a little north of the Kantâ-vilkku. You should return to Matti with your report.\n",
[10339]="70030E08\n1\tResupply the south-western tower\tThe arrows are at the top of a tower to the east and need to be carried to a tower at the south-west of town.\n2\tTalk to Cendal\tCendal is in Eaworth. Cendal will be pleased to hear the south-west tower has been resupplied with arrows.\n",
[10340]="70049FF3\n1\tExperience the fellowship version of the Retake Weathertop instance\tExperience the fellowship version of the Retake Weathertop instance.\n2\tCompleted\t\n",
[10341]="70049FF2\n1\tExperience the solo version of the Retake Weathertop instance\tExperience the solo version of the Retake Weathertop instance.\n2\tCompleted\t\n",
[10342]="7000E8BA\n1\tTalk to Candaith and retake Weathertop\tCandaith is at his camp at the north-west foot of Weathertop in the Lone-lands, far to the east of Bree. You have been asked to assist him in driving a company of Orcs from Weathertop. He told you to gather allies and return to him when you are prepared.\n2\tTalk to Candaith\tCandaith is at his camp at the north-west foot of Weathertop. Candaith is waiting to discuss with you the strange events that occurred atop Amon Sûl. This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\n",
[10343]="7003FD13\n1\tSpeak to the soldiers and select your target building\tBefore the operation can begin, you must select which area of the city you wish to retake.\n2\tSpeak to the Commander to begin the assault\tSpeak to the commander to begin the assault.\n",
[10344]="7006B768\n1\tLocate Irkiri to the east of Maurûsh\tFind Irkiri scouting to the east of Maurûsh and collect her scouting report for Galâmka.\n2\tRetrieve the scouting report from Irkiri\t\n3\tLocate Emlû to the south of Maurûsh\tFind Emlû scouting to the south of Maurûsh and collect his scouting report for Galâmka.\n4\tSearch Emlû for the scouting report\tSearch Emlû to see if you can find his scouting report\n5\tLocate Zukhal to the west of Maurûsh\tFind Zukhal scouting to the west of Maurûsh and collect her scouting report for Galâmka.\n6\tRetrieve the scouting report from Zukhal\tRetrieve the scouting report from Zukhal.\n7\tDeliver scouting reports to Galâmka in Ub Nishir\tBring the scouting reports back to Galâmka in Ub Nishir.\n",
[10345]="700442FC\n1\tDefeat Sûhalar at Parth Duin (total: 12)\tParth Duin is located east of Crithost. You should defeat Easterlings at this settlement.\n2\tTalk to Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[10346]="70041610\n1\tReach the winch to the Great Gate\tReach the winch to the Great Gate so it can be opened for Aragorn's force.\n2\tDefend the gate winch\tDefend the winch while the winch operator raises the Great Gate for Aragorn's force.\n3\tRout the pillagers in Pelargir\tRout the pillagers throughout Pelargir on the way to joining Aragorn at the piers.\n4\tHold Aragorn's flank\tHold Aragorn's flank as he confronts the main Corsair host.\n5\tBrace yourself\tThe Oathbreakers have swept over the Corsair host, driving them back in supernatural terror.\n6\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n",
[10347]="70041611\n1\tReach the winch to the Great Gate\tReach the winch to the Great Gate so it can be opened for Aragorn's force.\n2\tDefend the gate winch\tDefend the winch while the winch operator raises the Great Gate for Aragorn's force.\n3\tRout the pillagers in Pelargir\tRout the pillagers throughout Pelargir on the way to joining Aragorn at the piers.\n4\tHold Aragorn's flank\tHold Aragorn's flank as he confronts the main Corsair host.\n5\tBrace yourself\tThe Oathbreakers have swept over the Corsair host, driving them back in supernatural terror.\n6\tCheck this stage in the quest journal.\t\n",
[10348]="70027716\n1\tDefeat Dunlending sentries (total: 6)\tThe River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen. Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch. Your first step is to eliminate the sentries that guard the western approach.\n2\tSummon Rohirrim Soldiers and Destroy crude barricades (total: 8)\tThe River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen. Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch. You can call for the aid of Rohirrim soldiers from the banner on the northern path into River-watch.\n3\tThe River-watch is a place of strategic importance near the Ford of Isen. Grimbold has commanded you to take the control of the River-watch. You should call forth a band of Rohirrim wardens to charge the top of the Riverwatch and defeat the Dunlending captain, Neilun.\t\n4\tTalk to Grimbold at the Ford of Isen\tGrimbold is at the Ford of Isen. You should inform Grimbold that the Rohirrim have retaken the River-watch.\n",
[10349]="70047451\n1\tDefeat Orcs in Torngroth (total: 12)\030Collect abandoned supplies in Torngroth (total: 8)\tTorngroth can be found far to the north of Henneth Annûn. Mablung has asked you to defeat the Orcs that have laid claim to Torngroth and recover supplies that were left behind.\n2\tDeliver the supplies to Mablung\tMablung can be found in Henneth Annûn. You have defeated many of the invading Orcs in Torngroth and recovered as many supplies as you could bear. You should now deliver them to Mablung.\n",
[10350]="700442A6\n1\tComplete Quest: The North Rammas: Sûhalar\030Complete Quest: The North Rammas: Captains\030Complete Quest: The North Rammas: Supplies\030Complete Quest: The North Rammas: Hooks\030Complete Quest: The North Rammas: Banners\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold and assist him with protecting the Rammas.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[10351]="70041368\n1\tEnter the stronghold at Barad Rill\tBarad Rill is located at the southern tip of Dor-en-Ernil. Enter the stronghold at Barad Rill.\n2\tDefeat Dolgimil's Corsair lieutenants (total: 2)\030Defeat Dolgimil's Haradrim lieutenant\tDolgimil's lieutenants can be found in the stronghold at Barad Rill. Defeat Dolgimil's lieutenants.\n3\tSummon and confront Dolgimil at Barad Rill\tDolgimil can be found somewhere in Barad Rill. Summon and confront Dolgimil.\n4\tSpeak with Aras at Herion's encampment\tAras can be found at encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil. You should speak with Aras.\n5\tSpeak with Herion at his encampment\tHerion can be found at his encampment in western Dor-en-Ernil. You should speak with Herion.\n",
[10352]="70059741\n1\tDefeat Tarkríp tree-reavers (total: 8)\030Defeat Tarkríp fire-starters (total: 8)\tTarkríp tree-reavers and tree-burners can be found in the central Wildwood. Thornmane has asked you to defeat the Orcs who are wreaking havoc upon the Wildwood's forest.\n2\tTalk to Thornmane\tThornmane is in the southern Wildwood. You should talk to Thornmane.\n",
[10353]="7001BE59\n1\tDefeat Glúmir and recover the rune-shards\tGlúmir can be found in Sarnúr, south of Thorin's Hall, reached through the ruins of Orodost. Rútur has asked you to find the Dourhand Glúmir, defeat him, and recover any rune-shards you may find.\n2\tTalk to Rútur in Thorin's Hall\tRútur is in Thorin's Hall, north of Sarnúr, just outside the Blue Stone Garrison. You should bring the rune-shard to Rútur and tell him of Glúmir's defeat.\n",
[10354]="70018FC3\n1\tBurn Orc filth in a fire inside one of the Orc camps of Nanduhirion\tThe Orc camps of Uruk-gashan, Drû-garmadh, and Athmadhul can be found all along the road that runs through Nanduhirion, west and north of Echad Andestel. Dindirith has asked you to burn the Orc filth you collected in one of the fires the Orcs have set in their camps in Nanduhirion.\n2\tTalk to Dindirith\tDindirith is in Echad Andestel, the camp north of the road outside Lórien, and east of Nanduhirion. You have disposed of the Orc filth and should return now to Dindirith.\n",
[10355]="700072EB\n1\tBring the wine-cask to Bregedúr\tBregedúr spends his time at the crafters' market in Celondim. Brethilwen crushed the grapes you collected into a fine wine and sent them on to her friend Bregedúr in Celondim.\n",
[10356]="70066587\n1\tTalk to Garvir at Barad Rill\tHerion wants you to talk to Garvir at Barad Rill to see if he needs help. Garvir can be found in Barad Rill to the south.\n",
[10357]="70064EF1\n1\tTalk to Rock\tBy completing this quest, you will receive a Sárskillin barter currency allowance.\n",
[10358]="7006D54D\n1\tTalk to the Dumûri warrior\tContinue talking to the Dumûri warrior, should you wish to return to the Dubarâkh.\n",
[10359]="70066290\n1\tTalk to Lathlorn in Edhellond\tGilanor has asked you to deliver the Elf-relics to Lathlorn in Edhellond. Edhellond is located to the north-west of Ost Lontir.\n",
[10360]="700304CA\n1\tWarn Thane Radwig of the approaching forces of Mordor\tThane Radwig and his mother Etta are in the Mead Hall of Floodwend. You should head to the Mead Hall of Floodwend and tell the Thane and Etta of the enemy movements in the Wold.\n",
[10361]="7006F17C\n1\tTalk to Ikhajât\tContinue talking to Ikhajât, should you wish to return to Furtherholm.\n",
[10362]="7006D560\n1\tTalk to the Dumûri warrior\tContinue talking to the Dumûri warrior if you are ready to return to Iridír.\n",
[10363]="7003046B\n1\tTalk to Fastred in Snowbourn\tFastred can be found inside the mead-hall of Snowbourn.\n",
[10364]="7003E573\n1\tTalk to Elrohir\tElrohir is at Thorenhad, which can be reached by following the trail east and south from Calenthon's camp. Calenthon suggested that you bring a report to Elrohir at Thorenhad.\n",
[10365]="7002827C\n1\tDefeat wights in Lhan Gogledh (total: 5)\tDefeat the wights that protect Trehéarn Brenin in Lhan Gogledh.\n",
[10366]="700270F8\n1\tTalk to Elder Déin at Lhan Rhos\tElder Déin is at Lhan Rhos, south of the Boar-clan encampment. Blaire has asked you to talk to Elder Déin and call an assembly of the Avanc-lûth.\n",
[10367]="70071632\n1\tComplete 'Instance: Return to the Royal Quarters'\tWith Emax Dûl becoming embroiled in fighting, Sorkamâl is concerned that items of great historical value will be lost. You should talk to Sorkamâl and complete 'Instance: Return to the Royal Quarters'.\n2\tTalk to Sorkamâl\tYou have retrieved what you could from the royal living quarters of the palace. You should talk to Sorkamâl.\n",
[10368]="70041783\n1\tCollect stolen supplies (total: 8)\tThe stolen army supplies can be found in the abandoned district to the north-east of Tol Ciryarani. You should reclaim the stolen supplies.\n2\tTalk to Thandor\tThandor, the Gondorian Captain, can be located in the market east of Tol Ciryarani. You should speak with Thandor.\n",
})
